    "summary": "Staged migration path recommended: Node 14 → 16 → 18 → 20",
    "selectedTargetPath": "staged-16-18-20",
    "rationale": "Two critical deprecated dependencies (request, node-sass) require replacement before Node 20 migration. A staged approach allows testing at each LTS version and reduces risk.",
